## Development

The grammar and package manifest are generated from `Expressif.Syntax`. To verify generated artifacts, restore local .NET tools, run `npm ci --prefix tests`, install Rouge 4.6.1, and run `./Test-Highlighters.ps1`. Run `./Test-VsCodeExtension.ps1 -PackagePath <path-to-vsix>` to verify the packaged extension contract.
